        </div></div><div class="lurch-atom-body"><table><colgroup><col><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><td colspan="2"><b>Imported dependency document</b></td></tr><tr><td>Description:</td><td><tt>none</tt></td></tr><tr><td>Filename:</td><td><tt>learn/algebra/rules/Logic-theorems-Rules.lurch</tt></td></tr><tr><td>Source:</td><td>the web</td></tr><tr><td>Auto-refresh:</td><td>yes</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div>
            <div id="document"><h1>Set Theory</h1>
<p>We now define a formal system for elementary naive set theory.</p>
<h3>Constants</h3>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;Declare in, nonempty, empty, subset, cap, cup, complement, setminus , powerset, cross&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">Declare </span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__text">, nonempty, empty, </span><span class="ML__cmr">⊆</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__cmr">∩</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__cmr">∪</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.81em;"><span style="top: -3.41em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.39em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__cmr">∖</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__script" style="margin-right: 0.09em;">P</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text">and </span></span><span class="ML__cmr">×</span></span></span></span></span> to be constants.</p>
<h3>Definitions</h3>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Empty &nbsp;</strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If A is empty&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__text"> is empty</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x notin A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∉</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Empty</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;premise&quot;" data-shell_title="Premise:">
<p><em>Given</em></p>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;Let x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">Let </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span> be arbitrary</p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x notin A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∉</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<p><em>Conclude <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;A is empty&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__text"> is empty</span></span></span></span></span></em></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Nonempty</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If A is nonempty&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__text"> is nonempty</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in A for some x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__text"> for some </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Nonempty&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If x in A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp; then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;A is nonempty&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__text"> is nonempty</span></span></span></span></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Empty set &nbsp; </strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;A is empty equiv A={}&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__text"> is empty</span><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__cmr">≡&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">{</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Set</strong> <strong>builder</strong>&nbsp; We allow the built-in <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;set builder rule&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">set builder rule</span></span></span></span></span> to validate membership in sets specified in set builder notation of the form <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;\\left\\{ x \\in S : \\mathcal{P}_1(x),\\ldots,\\mathcal{P}_n(x)\\right\\}&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.25em; height: 1em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">{</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">:</span><span class="ML__cal" style="margin-right: 0.09em;">P</span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.31em;"><span style="top: -2.85em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.46em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">),</span><span class="ML__cmr">…</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__cal" style="margin-right: 0.09em;">P</span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.16em;"><span style="top: -2.85em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">)</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">}</span></span></span></span></span></span> where '<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;\\in S&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span></span></span></span></span>' is optional, <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;S&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span></span></span></span></span> can be any set, and <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;n&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span></span> is a positive integer.&nbsp; This rule is equivalent to the rule scheme<br><br></p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;z \\in \\left\\{ x \\in S : \\mathcal{P}_1(x),\\ldots,\\mathcal{P}_n(x)\\right\\} \\equiv z \\in S,\\mathcal{P}_1(z),\\ldots, \\mathcal{P}_n(z) &quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.25em; height: 1em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">{</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">:</span><span class="ML__cal" style="margin-right: 0.09em;">P</span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.31em;"><span style="top: -2.85em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.46em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">),</span><span class="ML__cmr">…</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__cal" style="margin-right: 0.09em;">P</span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.16em;"><span style="top: -2.85em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">)</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">}</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">≡</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__cal" style="margin-right: 0.09em;">P</span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.31em;"><span style="top: -2.85em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.46em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span><span class="ML__cmr">),</span><span class="ML__cmr">…</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__cal" style="margin-right: 0.09em;">P</span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.16em;"><span style="top: -2.85em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span><span class="ML__cmr">)</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<hr>
<p><strong>Finite set notation:</strong></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in {a} equiv x=a&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">{</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">}</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__cmr">≡&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in {a,b} equiv x=a or x=b&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">{</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">}</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__cmr">≡&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__text"> or </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in set(a,b,c) equiv x=a or x=b or x=c&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">{</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">c</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">}</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__cmr">≡&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__text"> or </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__text"> or </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">c</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in {a,b,c,d} equiv \nx=a or x=b or x=c or x=d&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">{</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">c</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">d</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">}</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__cmr">≡&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__text"> or </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__text"> or </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">c</span><span class="ML__text"> or </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">d</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Useful trivialities</strong> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;a in {a}&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">{</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">}</span></span></span></span></span></span>, <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;a in {a,b}&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">{</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">}</span></span></span></span></span></span>, <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;b in {a,b}&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">{</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">}</span></span></span></span></span></span>, <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;a in {a,b,c} &quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">{</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">c</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">}</span></span></span></span></span></span>, <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;b in {a,b,c} &quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">{</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">c</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">}</span></span></span></span></span></span>, <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;c in {a,b,c} &quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">c</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">{</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">c</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">}</span></span></span></span></span></span>, <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;a in {a,b,c,d} &quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">{</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">c</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">d</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">}</span></span></span></span></span></span>, <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;b in {a,b,c,d} &quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">{</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">c</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">d</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">}</span></span></span></span></span></span>, <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;c in {a,b,c,d} &quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">c</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">{</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">c</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">d</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">}</span></span></span></span></span></span>, and <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;d in {a,b,c,d} &quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">d</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">{</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">c</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">d</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<hr>
<div>
<div>
<p><strong>Set Relations</strong></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Subset-</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If A subset B, x in A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">⊆</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span> then<em> </em><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in B&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Subset+</strong>:</p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;premise&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><em>Given</em></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;Let x in A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">Let </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in B&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<p><em>Conclude </em><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;A subset B&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">⊆</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Set equality:</strong></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;premise&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><em>Given</em></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;Let a in A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">Let </span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;a in B&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;Let b in B&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">Let </span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;b in A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;A=B&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span></span></span></span></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>
</div>
<hr>
<p><strong>Sets from other sets</strong></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Powerset</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;A in powerset(B) equiv A subset B&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__script" style="margin-right: 0.09em;">P</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.68333em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__cmr">≡&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">⊆</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Intersection</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in A intersect B&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">∩</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span></span></span></span></span> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;equiv&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;≡&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span> , <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in B&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Union</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;a in A union B equiv x in A or x in B&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">∪</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__cmr">≡&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__text"> or </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Relative Complement</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in A setminus B&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">∖</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;equiv&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;≡&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span> , <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x notin B&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∉</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Complement</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in B complement equiv x notin B&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.81em;"><span style="top: -3.41em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.39em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;≡&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∉</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div><hr>
<p><strong>Cartesian product</strong></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Binary <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;\\times&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">×</span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp; </strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If z in A cross B&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">×</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span></span></span></span></span> then&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;z=[a,b] and a in A and b in B for some a,b&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">⟨</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">⟩</span></span><span class="ML__text"> and </span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__text"> and </span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span><span class="ML__text"> for some </span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Binary <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;\\times&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">×</span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp; </strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;pair(a,b) in A cross B&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">⟨</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">⟩</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">×</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span></span></span></span></span> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;equiv&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;≡&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;a in A,&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;b in B&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Ternary&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;\\times&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">×</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp;</strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If z in A cross B cross C&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">×</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span><span class="ML__cmr">×</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.08em;">C</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;z=[a,b,c] and a in A and b in B and c in C for some a,b,c&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">⟨</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">c</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">⟩</span></span><span class="ML__text"> and </span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__text"> and </span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span><span class="ML__text"> and </span><span class="ML__mathit">c</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.08em;">C</span><span class="ML__text"> for some </span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text">and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit">c</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Ternary <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;\\times&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">×</span></span></span></span></span></strong> &nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;[a,b,c] in A cross B cross C&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">⟨</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">c</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">⟩</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">×</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span><span class="ML__cmr">×</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.08em;">C</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;equiv&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;≡&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;a in A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span>, <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;b in B,&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span></span></span></span></span> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;c in C&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">c</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.08em;">C</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
<hr><strong>Indexed Union and Intersection</strong>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Indexed Union: </strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If x in Union i in I of @A(i)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.06em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.85em;"><span style="height: 0.51em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit">i</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.08em;">I</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">⋃</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cal">A</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.65952em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">i</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in @A(j) for some j in I&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__cal">A</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.85396em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">j</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__text"> for some </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">j</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.08em;">I</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Indexed Union: </strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If j in I, x in @A(j) &quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">j</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.08em;">I</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__cal">A</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.85396em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">j</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in Union i in I of @A(i)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.06em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.85em;"><span style="height: 0.51em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit">i</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.08em;">I</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">⋃</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cal">A</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.65952em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">i</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Indexed Intersection:&nbsp; </strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If x in Intersect i in I of @A(i), j in I&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.06em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.85em;"><span style="height: 0.51em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit">i</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.08em;">I</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">⋂</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cal">A</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.65952em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">i</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">j</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.08em;">I</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in @A(j)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__cal">A</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.85396em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">j</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Indexed Intersection</strong></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;premise&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><em>Given</em></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;Let j in I&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">Let </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">j</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.08em;">I</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in @A(j)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__cal">A</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.85396em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">j</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<p><em>Conclude</em> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in Intersect i in I of @A(i)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.06em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.85em;"><span style="height: 0.51em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit">i</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.08em;">I</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">⋂</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cal">A</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.65952em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">i</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
<hr>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
</div></div>
        </div></div><div class="lurch-atom-body"><table><colgroup><col><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><td colspan="2"><b>Imported dependency document</b></td></tr><tr><td>Description:</td><td><tt>none</tt></td></tr><tr><td>Filename:</td><td><tt>learn/algebra/rules/Sets-Rules.lurch</tt></td></tr><tr><td>Source:</td><td>the web</td></tr><tr><td>Auto-refresh:</td><td>yes</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div>
            <div id="document"><div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
</div>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h1>Set Theory Theorems</h1>
<p>This is a basic library of the rules that are theorems provable in the system defined by the rules in the Set Theory context.</p>
<hr>
<h3>Constants</h3>
<p>There are no new constants.</p>
<h3>Theorems</h3>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Theorem (double negative)&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in (S')' equiv x in S&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.801892em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.81em;"><span style="top: -3.41em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.39em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.93em;"><span style="top: -3.53em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.39em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;≡&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Theorem (excluded middle)&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in S union S'&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">∪</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.81em;"><span style="top: -3.41em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.39em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Theorem (commutativity of 'or')</strong>&nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If x in S union T&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">∪</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in T union S&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span><span class="ML__cmr">∪</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Theorem (alternate or-) &nbsp; </strong>&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If x in S union T, x notin S&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">∪</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∉</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in T&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Theorem (alternate or-)</strong> &nbsp; <strong>&nbsp; </strong>&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If x in S union T, x notin T&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">∪</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∉</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in S&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Theorem (contrapositive)</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If S subset T, x notin T&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">⊆</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∉</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x notin S&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∉</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Theorem (DeMorgan's Law)</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in (S intersect T)' equiv x in S' union T'&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.68333em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">∩</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.81em;"><span style="top: -3.41em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.39em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;≡&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.81em;"><span style="top: -3.41em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.39em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">∪</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.81em;"><span style="top: -3.41em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.39em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Theorem (DeMorgan's Law)</strong> &nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in (S union T)' equiv x in S' intersect T'&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.68333em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">∪</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.81em;"><span style="top: -3.41em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.39em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;≡&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.81em;"><span style="top: -3.41em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.39em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">∩</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.81em;"><span style="top: -3.41em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.39em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Theorem (associativity of 'or')&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in (S union T) union U ≡ x in S union (T union U)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.68333em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">∪</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">∪</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">U</span><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__cmr">≡&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">∪</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.68333em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span><span class="ML__cmr">∪</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">U</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div>
<h3><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;n&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span></span>-ary associative operators</h3>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Definition (ternary 'or')&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in S union T union U&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">∪</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span><span class="ML__cmr">∪</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">U</span></span></span></span></span> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;equiv &quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;≡&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in S or (T or U)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__text"> or </span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.68333em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span><span class="ML__text"> or </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">U</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Definition (quaternary or)</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in S or T or U or V&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__text"> or </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span><span class="ML__text"> or </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">U</span><span class="ML__text"> or </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.23em;">V</span></span></span></span></span> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;equiv &quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;≡&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in S or (T or (U or V))&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__text"> or </span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.25em; height: 1em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span><span class="ML__text"> or </span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.68333em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">U</span><span class="ML__text"> or </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.23em;">V</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Definition (ternary 'and')</strong> &nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in S intersect T intersect U&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">∩</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span><span class="ML__cmr">∩</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">U</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;equiv&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;≡&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in S, x in T, x in U&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">U</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Definition (quaternary 'and')</strong> &nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in S intersect T intersect U intersect V&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">∩</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span><span class="ML__cmr">∩</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">U</span><span class="ML__cmr">∩</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.23em;">V</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;equiv&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;≡&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in S, x in T, x in U, x in V&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">U</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.23em;">V</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<hr>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</div></div>
        </div></div><div class="lurch-atom-body"><table><colgroup><col><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><td colspan="2"><b>Imported dependency document</b></td></tr><tr><td>Description:</td><td><tt>none</tt></td></tr><tr><td>Filename:</td><td><tt>learn/algebra/rules/Sets-theorems-Rules.lurch</tt></td></tr><tr><td>Source:</td><td>the web</td></tr><tr><td>Auto-refresh:</td><td>yes</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div data-category="settings" data-key="shell style" data-value-type="json">"boxed"</div></div>
            <div id="document"><div>
<h1>Functions</h1>
<p>We now define a elementary concepts related to functions.&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<h3>Constants</h3>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;Declare id, ^, inv, circ, injective, surjective, bijective&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">Declare id, </span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.81em;"><span style="top: -3.41em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.39em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">∧</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__text">, inv, </span><span class="ML__cmr">∘</span><span class="ML__text">, injective, surjective</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__text">bijective</span></span></span></span></span> to be constants.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<h3>Definitions</h3>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Function Application: </strong>&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If f:A to B, x in A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__cmr">:</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">→</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;f(x) in B&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Definition of function:&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;premise&quot;" data-shell_title="Premise:">
<p><em>Given</em></p>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;Let a in A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">Let </span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;exists! b in B.@P(a,b)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">∃!</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span><span class="ML__cmr">.</span><span class="ML__cal" style="margin-right: 0.09em;">P</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;f:A to B, (forall x in A.@P(x,f(x))) for some f&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__cmr">:</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">→</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.25em; height: 1em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__cmr">∀</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">.</span><span class="ML__cal" style="margin-right: 0.09em;">P</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.25em; height: 1em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__text"> for some </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Function Rule:</strong>&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If f = x mapsto @P(x) &quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">↦</span><span class="ML__cal" style="margin-right: 0.09em;">P</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;f(z)=@P(z)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__cal" style="margin-right: 0.09em;">P</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Function Equality</strong></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;premise&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><em>Given</em></p>
<p><em><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;f:A to B&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__cmr">:</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">→</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span></span></span></span></span></em></p>
<p><em><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;g:A to B&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">g</span><span class="ML__cmr">:</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">→</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span></span></span></span></span></em></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;Let x in A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">Let </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;f(x)=g(x)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">g</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<p><em>Conclude</em> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;f=g&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">g</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Image of a Set:</strong>&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If x in S&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span></span></span></span></span> then&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;f(x) in f(S)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.68333em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Image of a Set:</strong> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;if y in f(S)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">if </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.68333em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;y=f(x) for some x in S&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__text"> for some </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Identity map</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;id_(A):A to A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">id</span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.33em;"><span style="top: -2.85em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.48em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">:</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">→</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span> and <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;id_(A)(x)=x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">id</span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.33em;"><span style="top: -2.85em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.48em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Composition&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If f:A to B, g:B to C&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__cmr">:</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">→</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">g</span><span class="ML__cmr">:</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span><span class="ML__cmr">→</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.08em;">C</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;g comp f:A to C&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">g</span><span class="ML__cmr">∘</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__cmr">:</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">→</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.08em;">C</span></span></span></span></span> and <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;(g comp f)(x)=g(f(x))&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">g</span><span class="ML__cmr">∘</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">g</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.25em; height: 1em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Injective</strong> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If f is injective, f(x)=f(y)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__text"> is injective</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.625em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x=y&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Injective:</strong></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;premise&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><em>Given</em></p>
<p><em><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;f:A to B&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__cmr">:</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">→</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span></span></span></span></span></em></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;Let x,y be such that x in A and y in A and f(x)=f(y)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">Let </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> be such that </span></span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__text"> and </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__text"> and </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.625em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x=y&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<p><em>Conclude</em> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;f is injective&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__text"> is injective</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Surjective</strong>&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If f:A to B, f is surjective, b in B&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__cmr">:</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">→</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__text"> is surjective</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span></span></span></span></span> then&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;b=f(a) for some a in A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__text"> for some </span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Surjective:</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;premise&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><em>Given</em></p>
<p><em><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;f:A to B&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__cmr">:</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">→</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span></span></span></span></span></em></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;Let b in B&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">Let </span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;b=f(a)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span> and <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;a in A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<p><span style="background-color: var(--semantic-hover-color); font-size: var(--base-font-size);"><em>Conclude</em> </span><span class="lurch-atom" style="font-size: var(--base-font-size);" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;f is surjective&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__text"> is surjective</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Bijective</strong>&nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;f is bijective&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__text"> is bijective</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;equiv&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;≡&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;f is injective&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__text"> is injective</span></span></span></span></span> ,&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;f is surjective&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__text"> is surjective</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Inverse map</strong> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If f:A to B, f is bijective&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__cmr">:</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">→</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__text"> is bijective</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;f^(-1):B to A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.87em;"><span style="top: -3.41em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.51em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">−1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">:</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span><span class="ML__cmr">→</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span>, <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;f^(-1)(f(a))=a&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.87em;"><span style="top: -3.41em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.51em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">−1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.25em; height: 1em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span></span></span></span></span>, and <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;f(f^(-1)(b))=b&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.25em; height: 1.1141079999999999em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size1">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.87em;"><span style="top: -3.41em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.51em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">−1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.69444em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size1">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Inverse image</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;a in f^inv(S)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.89em;"><span style="top: -3.41em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.47em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__text">inv</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.68333em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;equiv&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;≡&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;f(a) in S&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Inverse image&nbsp; </strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If f: A to B, U subset B&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__cmr">:</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">→</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">U</span><span class="ML__cmr">⊆</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;f^inv(U) subset A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.89em;"><span style="top: -3.41em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.47em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__text">inv</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.68333em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">U</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">⊆</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Binary Operators &nbsp;</strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If a in A, b in B, f:A cross B to C&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__cmr">:</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">×</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span><span class="ML__cmr">→</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.08em;">C</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;f([a,b])=f(a,b)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.25em; height: 1em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">⟨</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">⟩</span></span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span> and <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;f(a,b) in C&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.08em;">C</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Theorem (common definition of function) </strong>&nbsp;</p>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;premise&quot;" data-shell_title="Premise:">
<p><em>Given</em></p>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;Let a in A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">Let </span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;@E(a) in B&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cal" style="margin-right: 0.09em;">E</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;f:A to B, forall x in A.f(x)=@E(x) for some f&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__cmr">:</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">→</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">B</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__cmr">∀</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">.</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__cal" style="margin-right: 0.09em;">E</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__text"> for some </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.11em;">f</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
</div></div>
        </div></div><div class="lurch-atom-body"><table><colgroup><col><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><td colspan="2"><b>Imported dependency document</b></td></tr><tr><td>Description:</td><td><tt>none</tt></td></tr><tr><td>Filename:</td><td><tt>learn/algebra/rules/Functions-Rules.lurch</tt></td></tr><tr><td>Source:</td><td>the web</td></tr><tr><td>Auto-refresh:</td><td>yes</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div data-category="settings" data-key="shell style" data-value-type="json">"boxed"</div></div>
            <div id="document"><div>
<h1>Relations</h1>
<p>We now define a formal system for defining elementary concepts for relations.</p>
<p>There is a fine point here for convenience.&nbsp; The operator <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;\\sim&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">∼</span></span></span></span></span> when entered with the keyboard character <code>~</code> is declared to be a constant and can be subscripted to provide an infinite family of constant relations.&nbsp; But the rules below have to apply to any of those, so in the rules we use <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;\\backsim&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span></span></span></span></span> (entered as the symbol <code>rel</code>)&nbsp; which is not declared to be a constant so it can be replaced by any of the constant relations when doing proofs.</p>
</div>
<h3>Constants</h3>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;Declare ~, relation,reflexive, symmetric, transitive, irreflexive, antisymmetric&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">Declare </span><span class="ML__cmr">∼</span><span class="ML__text">, relation, reflexive, symmetric, transitive, irreflexive</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__text">antisymmetric</span></span></span></span></span> and<br><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;declare total, partial order, strict partial order, total order&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">declare total, partial order, strict partial order</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__text">total order</span></span></span></span></span>, and<br><span class="lurch-atom atom-is-selected" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;declare equivalence relation, partition, class&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">declare equivalence relation, partition</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__text">class</span></span></span></span></span> to be constants.</p>
<h3>Definitions</h3>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Relations as a set of pairs</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x rel y&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;equiv&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;≡&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;⟨x,y⟩ in rel&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.625em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">⟨</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">⟩</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Relation on a set&nbsp; </strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is a relation on A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is a relation on </span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;equiv&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;≡&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel subset A cross A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__cmr">⊆</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">×</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Relation on a set&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If rel is a relation on A, x rel y&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is a relation on </span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" style="font-size: var(--base-font-size);" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x in A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span> and<em> </em><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;y in A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
<div>
<div>
<h4>Equivalence Relations</h4>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Reflexive</strong> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If rel is a relation on A, rel is reflexive&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is a relation on </span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is reflexive</span></span></span></span></span> then<em> </em><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x rel x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Reflexive</strong></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;premise&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><em>Given</em></p>
<p><em><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is a relation on A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is a relation on </span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span></em></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;Let x in A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">Let </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x rel x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<p><span style="background-color: var(--semantic-hover-color); font-size: var(--base-font-size);"><em>Conclude</em> </span><span class="lurch-atom" style="font-size: var(--base-font-size);" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is reflexive&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is reflexive</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Symmetric</strong> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If rel is a relation on A, rel is symmetric, x rel y&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is a relation on </span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is symmetric</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span></span></span> then&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;y rel x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Symmetric</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;premise&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><em>Given</em></p>
<p><em><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is a relation on A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is a relation on </span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span></em></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;Let x,y be such that x rel y&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">Let </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> be such that </span></span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;y rel x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<p><em>Conclude</em> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is symmetric&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is symmetric</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Transitive&nbsp;</strong> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If rel is a relation on A, rel is transitive, x rel y, y rel z&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is a relation on </span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is transitive, </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x rel z&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Transitive</strong></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;premise&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><em>Given</em></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is a relation on A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is a relation on </span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;Let x,y,z be such that x rel y and y rel z&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">Let </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> be such that </span></span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__text"> and </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x rel z&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<p><em>Conclude</em> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is transitive&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is transitive</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Equivalence relation:</strong> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If rel is a relation on A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is a relation on </span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span> then&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is an equivalence relation&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is an equivalence relation</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;equiv&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;≡&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p>1. <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is reflexive&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is reflexive</span></span></span></span></span>,</p>
<p>2. <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is symmetric&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is symmetric</span></span></span></span></span>, and</p>
<p>3. <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is transitive&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is transitive</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Equivalence class&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If rel is an equivalence relation&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is an equivalence relation</span></span></span></span></span> then</p>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x rel a equiv x in class(a)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__cmr">≡&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">[</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Partition</strong></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;premise&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><em>Given</em></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;A = Union S in P of S&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.06em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.85em;"><span style="height: 0.51em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">P</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">⋃</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;Let S,T be such that S in P and T in P&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">Let </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> be such that </span></span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">P</span><span class="ML__text"> and </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">P</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;S = T or S cap T = {}&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span><span class="ML__text"> or </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">∩</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">{</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<p><em>Conclude</em>&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;P is a partition of A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">P</span><span class="ML__text"> is a partition of </span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Partition&nbsp; </strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If P is a partition of A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">P</span><span class="ML__text"> is a partition of </span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;P subset powerset(A)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">P</span><span class="ML__cmr">⊆</span><span class="ML__script" style="margin-right: 0.09em;">P</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.68333em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span>, <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;{ } notin P&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">{</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">}</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">∉</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">P</span></span></span></span></span> and <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;A = Union S in P of S&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.06em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.85em;"><span style="height: 0.51em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">P</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">⋃</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Partition &nbsp;</strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If P is a partition of A, S in P, T in P&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">P</span><span class="ML__text"> is a partition of </span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">P</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">P</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;S=T or S cap T = { }&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span><span class="ML__text"> or </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">∩</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.14em;">T</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">{</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">}</span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Irreflexive</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If rel is a relation on A, rel is irreflexive, x in A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is a relation on </span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is irreflexive</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;not x rel x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">not </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Irreflexive</strong></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;premise&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><em>Given</em></p>
<p><em><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is a relation on A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is a relation on </span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</em></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;Let x in A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">Let </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;not x rel x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">not </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<p><em>Conclude</em> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is irreflexive&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is irreflexive</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Antisymmetric</strong> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If rel is a relation on A, rel is antisymmetric, x rel y, y rel x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is a relation on </span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is antisymmetric, </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x=y&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Antisymmetric</strong></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;premise&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><em>Given</em></p>
<p><em><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is a relation on A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is a relation on </span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span></em></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;Let x,y be such that x rel y and y rel x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">Let </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> be such that </span></span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__text"> and </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x=y&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<p><em>Conclude</em> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is antisymmetric&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is antisymmetric</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Total</strong> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If rel is a relation on A, rel is total, x in A, y in A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is a relation on </span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is total, </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x rel y or y rel x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__text"> or </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Total</strong></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;premise&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><em>Given</em></p>
<p><em><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is a relation on A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is a relation on </span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span></em></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;Let x,y be such that x in A and y in A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">Let </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> be such that </span></span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__text"> and </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x rel y or y rel x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__text"> or </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<p><em>Conclude</em> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is total&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is total</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<h4>Orders</h4>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Partial Order</strong> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If rel is a relation on A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is a relation on </span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span> then</p>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is a partial order&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is a partial order</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;equiv&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;≡&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p>1. <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is reflexive&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is reflexive</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p>2. <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is antisymmetric&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is antisymmetric</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p>3. <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is transitive&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is transitive</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Strict Partial Order&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If rel is a relation on A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is a relation on </span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span> then</p>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p>&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is a strict partial order&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is a strict partial order</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;equiv&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;≡&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p>1. <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is irreflexive&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is irreflexive</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p>2. <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is transitive&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is transitive</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Total Order</strong> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If rel is a relation on A&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is a relation on </span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span></span></span></span></span> then</p>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is a total order&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is a total order</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;equiv&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;≡&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p>1. <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is antisymmetric&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is antisymmetric</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p>2. <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is transitive&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is transitive</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p>3. <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rel is total&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__ams">∽</span><span class="ML__text"> is total</span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
</div>
<hr>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</div></div>
        </div></div><div class="lurch-atom-body"><table><colgroup><col><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><td colspan="2"><b>Imported dependency document</b></td></tr><tr><td>Description:</td><td><tt>none</tt></td></tr><tr><td>Filename:</td><td><tt>learn/algebra/rules/Relations-Rules.lurch</tt></td></tr><tr><td>Source:</td><td>the web</td></tr><tr><td>Auto-refresh:</td><td>yes</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div>
            <div id="document"><div>
<h1>Real Numbers</h1>
</div>
<p>We can now define a formal system for the Real Numbers.</p>
<h3>Constants</h3>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;Declare -, +, *, &lt;, leq&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">Declare </span><span class="ML__cmr">−</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__cmr">⋅</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text">and </span></span><span class="ML__cmr">≤</span></span></span></span></span> to be a constants.</p>
<h3>Axioms</h3>
<p>We include here all of the axioms defining the real numbers except for the completeness axiom.</p>
<h4>Axioms of Arithmetic</h4>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Axioms for <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;x\\in\\R&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__bb">R</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp;</strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If x in RR&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__bb">R</span></span></span></span></span> then&nbsp;</p>
<ol>
<li><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x+0=x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span> and <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;0+x=x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span></li>
</ol>
<p>2. <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x+(-x)=0&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.08333em; height: 0.66666em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__cmr">−</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span></span></span></span></span> and&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;-x+x=0&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">−</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p>3. <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;1*x=x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span><span class="ML__cmr">⋅</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span> and <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x*1=x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">⋅</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p>4. <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If x neq 0 then &quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__rlap"><span class="ML__inner"><span class="ML__cmr"></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__text"> then </span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x*x^-=1,&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">⋅</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.83em;"><span style="top: -3.41em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.47em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__cmr">1,</span></span></span></span></span> and <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;(x^-)*x=1&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.821331em;"><span class="ML__open ML__delim-size1">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.83em;"><span style="top: -3.41em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.47em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="ML__close ML__delim-size1">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">⋅</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Axioms for <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;x,y\\in\\mathbb{R}&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__bb">R</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp;</strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If x, y in RR&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__bb">R</span></span></span></span></span> then</p>
<ol>
<li><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x+y=y+x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span></li>
<li><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x*y=y*x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">⋅</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">⋅</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span></li>
</ol>
<p>5. <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;if 0&lt;x, 0&lt;y then 0&lt;x*y&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">if </span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__text"> then </span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">⋅</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Axioms for <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;x,y,z\\in\\R&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__bb">R</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp;</strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If x, y, z in RR&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__bb">R</span></span></span></span></span> then</p>
<ol>
<li><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;(x+y)+z =x+(y+z)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.7777700000000001em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.7777700000000001em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
<li><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;(x*y)*z =x*(y*z)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.63889em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">⋅</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">⋅</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">⋅</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.63889em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">⋅</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
<li><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x*(y+z)=x*y+x*z&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">⋅</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.7777700000000001em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">⋅</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">⋅</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span></span></span></span></span></li>
<li><strong> </strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If x&lt;y&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x+z&lt;y+z&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span></span></span></span></span></li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div>The following axiom is not used in this context, but we list it here for completeness (pun).</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div><strong>Completeness:</strong> Every bounded above set of real numbers has a least upper bound.</div>
</div>
<hr>
<h2>Definitions for Real Numbers</h2>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;Declare /, positive, negative, nonnegative, nonzero, abs&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">Declare </span><span class="ML__cmr">/</span><span class="ML__text">, positive, negative, nonnegative, nonzero, </span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text">and </span></span><span class="ML__text">abs</span></span></span></span></span> to be constants.&nbsp; Note that the definition of subtraction is built-in so that <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;x-y&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">−</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span></span></span> and <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;x+(-y)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">(−</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">)</span></span></span></span></span> are synonyms.&nbsp; This is also true for quotients, in that <code>/y</code> is the multiplicative inverse of <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;y&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span></span></span> (formats as&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;\\frac1y&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.63em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>) and &nbsp;<code>x/y</code> is a synonym&nbsp; for <code>x * /y</code> (i.e., <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;\\frac{x}{y}=x\\cdot\\frac1y&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.94em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.63em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.44em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">⋅</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.63em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>).&nbsp; Some of these definitions are more universal definitions than definitions restricted to <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;\\R&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__bb">R</span></span></span></span></span>, so we state them separately.</p>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Definitions for <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;x\\in\\R&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__bb">R</span></span></span></span></span> </strong>&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If x in RR&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__bb">R</span></span></span></span></span> then</p>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><strong>Absolute value</strong> &nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If 0 leq x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">≤</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;abs(x)=x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">∣</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">∣</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span>.&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><strong>Absolute value</strong> &nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If x&lt;0&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;abs(x)=-x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.43056em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">∣</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">∣</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__cmr">−</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Definitions (universal)</strong></p>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><strong>Positive&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x is positive &quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__text"> is positive</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;equiv&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;≡&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;0&lt;x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><strong>Negative</strong> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x is negative&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__text"> is negative</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;equiv&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;≡&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x&lt;0&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><strong>Nonnegative&nbsp; </strong>&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x is nonnegative &quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__text"> is nonnegative</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;equiv&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;≡&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;0 leq x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">≤</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><strong>Nonzero&nbsp;</strong> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x is nonzero &quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__text"> is nonzero</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;equiv&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;≡&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x neq 0&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__rlap"><span class="ML__inner"><span class="ML__cmr"></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><strong>Quotient&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If y neq 0&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__rlap"><span class="ML__inner"><span class="ML__cmr"></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x/y = x * y^-&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.94em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.63em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.44em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">⋅</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.83em;"><span style="top: -3.41em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.47em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><strong>Less than or equal to&nbsp;</strong> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If x leq y&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">≤</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp; then&nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x&lt;y or x=y&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__text"> or </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><strong>Less than or equal to</strong> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If x&lt;y&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x leq y&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">≤</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><strong>Less than or equal to</strong> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If x=y&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x leq y&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">≤</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><strong>Less than</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x&lt;y&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;equiv&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;≡&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp; <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x leq y,&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">≤</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x neq y&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__rlap"><span class="ML__inner"><span class="ML__cmr"></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><strong>Trichotomy&nbsp; &nbsp; </strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x&lt;y or x=y or y&lt;x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__text"> or </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__text"> or </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><strong>Irreflexive&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;not (x&lt;x)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">not </span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.0391em; height: 0.5782em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;subproof&quot;" data-shell_title="">
<p><strong>Different identities&nbsp; </strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;1 neq 0&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span><span class="ML__rlap"><span class="ML__inner"><span class="ML__cmr"></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<h3>Theorems</h3>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Distributive law on the right&nbsp;</strong> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If x, y, z in RR&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__bb">R</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;(x+y)*z=x*z+y*z&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.7777700000000001em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">⋅</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">⋅</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">⋅</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.05em;">z</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Theorem (trapped) &nbsp;</strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If x leq y, y leq x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">≤</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">≤</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x=y&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
</div>
