<p><strong>Theorem (empty vs nonempty)&nbsp;</strong> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;A is nonempty equiv A is not empty&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__text"> is nonempty</span><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__cmr">≡&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__mathit">A</span><span class="ML__text"> is not empty</span></span></span></span></span></p>
