<h4>Number Theory (in <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;\\R&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__bb">R</span></span></span></span></span>)</h4>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Theorem (nothing between) &nbsp;</strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If n in ZZ, n&lt;x, x&lt;n+1&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x notin ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">∉</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
