            <div id="document"><h1>Arithmetic in&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;\\Z&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span> Revisited</h1>
<p>See the <a title="Modern Algebra Notes" href="https://monks.scranton.edu/files/courses/Math448/math-448-lecture.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">course notes for Modern Algebra</a> for details.</p>
<h3>Constants</h3>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;Declare min, quo, rem&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">Declare min, quo</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__text">rem</span></span></span></span></span> to be a constant.</p>
<h3>Definitions (typed quantifiers)</h3>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Well Ordering</strong> Axiom &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If S subset NN, S is nonempty&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">⊆</span><span class="ML__bb">N</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__text"> is nonempty</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;min(S) in S&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">min</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.68333em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span></span></span></span></span> and <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot; if n in S&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">if </span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;min(S) leq n&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">min</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.68333em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">≤</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
<h3>Theorems</h3>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Theorem (uniqueness of minimum)</strong> &nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If S subset NN, m in S, forall n in S.m leq n&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">⊆</span><span class="ML__bb">N</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__mathit">m</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__cmr">∀</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__cmr">.</span><span class="ML__mathit">m</span><span class="ML__cmr">≤</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;m=min(S)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">m</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__text">min</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: 0em; height: 0.68333em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.06em;">S</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Theorem (Division Algorithm in <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;\\Z&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span> - existence) </strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If a, b in ZZ, 0&lt;b&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span></span></span></span></span> then&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;a=q*b+r, 0 leq r &lt; b for some q,r in ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">q</span><span class="ML__cmr">⋅</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.03em;">r</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">≤</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.03em;">r</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__text"> for some </span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">q</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.03em;">r</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Theorem (Division Algorithm in <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;\\Z&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span> - uniqueness)&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If a, b, q, r, s, t in ZZ, 0&lt;b,&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">q</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.03em;">r</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">s</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">t</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span></span></span></span></span> and both</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;a=q*b+r, &quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">q</span><span class="ML__cmr">⋅</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.03em;">r</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span></span></span></span></span> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;0 leq r &lt; b,&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">≤</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.03em;">r</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span></span></span></span></span> and</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;a=s*b+t,&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit">s</span><span class="ML__cmr">⋅</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__mathit">t</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span></span></span></span></span> <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;0 leq t&lt;b&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">≤</span><span class="ML__mathit">t</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;s=q&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">s</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">q</span></span></span></span></span> and <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;t=r&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">t</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.03em;">r</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom unindented" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Definition of quo and rem&nbsp; </strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If a, b in ZZ, 0&lt;b&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span></span></span></span></span> then</p>
<p>1. <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;quo(a,b) in ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">quo</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p>2. <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rem(a,b) in NN&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">rem</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">∈</span><span class="ML__bb">N</span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p>3. <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;a=quo(a,b)*b+rem(a,b)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__text">quo</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">⋅</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__text">rem</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p>4. <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;0 leq rem(a,b)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">≤</span><span class="ML__text">rem</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span></span></span></span></span> and</p>
<p>5. <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;rem(a,b)&lt;b&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">rem</span><span class="ML__left-right" style="margin-top: -0.19444em; height: 0.8888799999999999em;"><span class="ML__small-delim ML__open">(</span><span class="ML__mathit">a</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span><span class="ML__small-delim ML__close">)</span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">b</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
</div>
